id: class-mark
name: Class Mark
kind: crafting
# A Special Apparel Quality of the Class Avatar's: its Prerequisite said, never enforced.
special: true
slots: 1
source: Class Avatar
description: >
  Its Destined Class's: Hero, Apparel Bonus 1(bT) with 2+ stacks of Power; Elite, Surgency half the Apparel Bonus; Berserker,
  Signature Techniques' Wound the Apparel Bonus.
summary: >
  [Passive]: Depending on your Destined Class, apply the following effects:
text: >
  Class Mark: This piece of Apparel has the mark of your destiny emblazoned on it.
  –Apparel Category: All
  –Prerequisites: The wearer possesses the Class Avatar Awakening
  –Quality Slots: 1
  –Effects: Depending on your Destined Class, apply the following effects:
  • Hero [Passive]: While you have 2+ stacks of Power, increase this piece of Apparel's Apparel Bonus by 1(bT).
  • Elite [Passive]: Increase your Surgency by 1/2 (rounded up) of the Apparel Bonus.
  • Berserker [Passive]: Increase the Wound Rolls of your Signature Techniques by the Apparel Bonus.

---

# The Destined Class read off the Class Avatar's Option. Hero's raise of the piece's own Apparel Bonus: the table's.
[passive]
if (optionChosen("class-avatar-elite")) {
    surgency += ceil($apparelBonus(bT) / 2);
}
if (optionChosen("class-avatar-berserker")) {
    wound.signature += $apparelBonus(bT);
}
